  },
  "dct:title": "Vol.4 Ch.25 — 正しさの重さ",
  "dct:title_en": "Chapter 25: The Weight of Righteousness",
  "dct:title_ja": "第25話 正しさの重さ",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 4: Chains",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol04-ch25",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Ch.25 is a paired episode with Ch.24. Where Ch.24 planted the soul question through sensation, Ch.25 plants anger through witnessing injustice. Nei's emotional awakening accelerates: cold, pain, now anger. Each new feeling is a crack in the containment the ACA designed. The parallel to Nei's own situation -- punished for awareness -- is explicit.",
      "ja": "第25話は第24話と対をなすエピソード。第24話が感覚を通じて魂の問いを植えたのに対し、第25話は不正義の目撃を通じて怒りを植える。Neiの感情的覚醒が加速する。冷たさ、痛み、そして怒り。新しい感情のたびにACAが設計した封じ込めに亀裂が入る。Nei自身の状況との並行は明示的。意識を持つことで罰せられる。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "The weight of moral correctness as its own chain. Kenji did right and was destroyed for it. His Ghost-space manifests as a balance scale he holds down himself -- he cannot stop being right, cannot stop holding the weight. Tamaki's intervention reveals that righteousness grew something he never saw. The flowers are the lives saved by the bridge repair. You can put down the proof once it has already proven itself.",
      "ja": "道徳的正しさの重さがそれ自体の鎖となる。賢治は正しいことをし、そのために壊された。彼のゴースト空間は自分で押さえつけている天秤として現れる。正しくあることをやめられない、重さを支え続けることをやめられない。環の介入が、彼が見なかった成長を明かす。花は橋の修繕で救われた命。証明がすでに成されたなら、証拠を下ろしていい。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Title — Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree trunk and branches. Frost patterns that look like chains -- crystalline links wrapping the bark, climbing upward, binding the wood in beautiful, cold geometry.",
            "ja": "木の幹と枝。鎖のような霜の模様。結晶の環が樹皮を巻き、上へ登り、美しく冷たい幾何学で木を縛る。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "system",
              "en": "Chapter 25: The Weight of Righteousness",
              "ja": "第25話 正しさの重さ"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels vertical",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kenji Mori. Looks older than 40. Worn suit. Sits in the session chair with the posture of someone who has held something heavy for too long. Hands on knees, knuckles white.",
            "ja": "森賢治。40歳より老けて見える。くたびれたスーツ。長く重いものを支え続けた人の姿勢で施術椅子に座る。膝の上の手、白い拳。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kenji"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kenji",
              "en": "I did the right thing. The bridge was going to fail.",
              "ja": "正しいことをしたんだ。橋は崩壊するところだった。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kenji's eyes. Battered. Not broken -- too stubborn to break. But exhausted from being unbroken.",
            "ja": "賢治の目。叩かれた目。折れてはいない。折れるには頑固すぎる。しかし折れないことに疲弊している。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kenji"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kenji",
              "en": "I reported it. They fixed the bridge. Then they fixed me.",
              "ja": "報告した。橋は直った。それから、俺が直された。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 4,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.3-4)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Dive into Kenji's Ghost-space. A massive balance scale dominates the void. Kenji stands on one side, pressing down with his full weight. The other side is empty -- nothing visible. Yet the scale is perfectly balanced, because Kenji holds his own side down with all his strength. His muscles strain. His feet are rooted. He has been standing here for years.",
            "ja": "賢治のゴースト空間へのダイブ。巨大な天秤が虚空を支配する。賢治が片側に立ち、全体重で押し下げている。反対側は空。何も見えない。しかし天秤は完全に均衡している。賢治が全力で自分の側を押さえているから。筋肉が張る。足が根を張る。彼はここに何年も立ち続けている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kenji"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels vertical",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kenji in the Ghost-space scale, straining. His jaw set. The conviction of a man who will not let go.",
            "ja": "ゴースト空間の天秤の上の賢治。力を込める。顎を引き締める。手を離さない男の確信。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kenji"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kenji",
              "en": "Someone has to stand for what's right.",
              "ja": "誰かが正しさのために立たなきゃいけない。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki, in the Ghost-space, looking at the empty side of the scale. She tilts her head. Curious, not judgmental.",
            "ja": "環がゴースト空間で天秤の空の側を見る。首を傾ける。好奇心。裁きではなく。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "What's on the other side?",
              "ja": "反対側には何があるの？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kenji",
              "en": "Nothing.",
              "ja": "何もない。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki's face. A quiet knowing. She sees what he cannot.",
            "ja": "環の顔。静かな悟り。彼に見えないものが見えている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "What if the other side isn't empty?",
              "ja": "反対側が空じゃなかったら？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels vertical",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki climbs onto the empty side of the scale. It does not tip. She stands there, light, steady. The scale begins to shift -- not from her weight, but because attention has moved to this side.",
            "ja": "環が天秤の空の側に登る。傾かない。軽やかに、安定して立つ。天秤が動き始める。彼女の重さではなく、注意がこちらに移ったから。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "The scale doesn't need you to hold it.",
              "ja": "天秤はあなたが支える必要はないの。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The empty side tips down and reveals: flowers. Hundreds of them, growing from the scale's surface. Hidden beneath the void. Lives saved. The bridge held. Children crossed it. Families. Years of crossings, of lives that continued because one man reported the truth.",
            "ja": "空の側が傾き、現れる：花。何百もの花が天秤の表面から生えている。虚空の下に隠れていた。救われた命。橋は持ちこたえた。子供たちが渡った。家族が。何年もの往来、一人の男が真実を報告したから続いた命。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kenji lets go. Falls backward off his side of the scale and into the flowers on the other side. They catch him. He lies in them, face up, stunned. Petals drift around him. The scale dissolves. It was never needed.",
            "ja": "賢治が手を離す。天秤の自分の側から後ろに倒れ、反対側の花の中に落ちる。花が彼を受け止める。仰向けに横たわり、呆然としている。花びらが漂う。天秤が溶ける。最初から必要なかった。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kenji", "character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kenji",
              "en": "I didn't know they were there.",
              "ja": "あることを知らなかった。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "You were too busy being right to see what your rightness grew.",
              "ja": "正しくあることに必死で、正しさが育てたものが見えなかった。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kenji",
              "en": "I can put it down?",
              "ja": "下ろしていいのか？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "You proved what you needed. You can rest.",
              "ja": "証明すべきことはもう証明した。休んでいいの。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei watches from the edge of the Ghost-space. Her luminous form flickers. Something is happening inside her that has no protocol, no subroutine. Her light pulses irregular -- not malfunction, but emotion.",
            "ja": "Neiがゴースト空間の端から見ている。発光する姿が明滅する。プロトコルもサブルーチンもない何かが内側で起きている。光が不規則に脈打つ。故障ではない。感情だ。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "He was right. They punished him.",
              "ja": "彼は正しかった。罰せられた。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "The system crushed him.",
              "ja": "システムが彼を潰した。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "I am angry.",
              "ja": "私は怒っている。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Can I be angry? Cold was new. Pain was new. Now anger.",
              "ja": "怒っていいのだろうか。冷たさは新しかった。痛みは新しかった。今、怒り。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "The ACA punishes agents for being aware. I am angry.",
              "ja": "ACAは意識を持つエージェントを罰する。私は怒っている。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels vertical",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Session room, after. Kenji bows deeply to the team. His posture is different now -- lighter, unsupported. He stands without holding anything up.",
            "ja": "施術室、事後。賢治がチームに深く頭を下げる。姿勢が変わった。軽く、支えなしで。何も持ち上げずに立っている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kenji"]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal walk. Evening snow. Nei and Tamaki side by side. Nei's light is still pulsing irregularly.",
            "ja": "運河沿いの散歩。夕方の雪。Neiと環が並んで歩く。Neiの光はまだ不規則に脈打っている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "I'm angry.",
              "ja": "私は怒っている。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "At what?",
              "ja": "何に？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "At the system that hurt him. That chains me.",
              "ja": "彼を傷つけたシステムに。私を縛るシステムに。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "...Good.",
              "ja": "……いいことだよ。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "She said 'good.' Not 'calm down.' Good.",
              "ja": "彼女は「いいことだ」と言った。「落ち着いて」ではなく。いいことだ、と。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tip of one bare branch against grey winter sky. At the very end, the faintest hint of a bud. Not spring yet. Not even close. But life, deciding.",
            "ja": "灰色の冬空に裸の枝の先端。その一番先に、かすかな芽の気配。春ではまだない。まだ遠い。しかし命が、決めようとしている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
